{"about_the_game":"In 1960s Japan, Shimizu Hinako's secluded town of Ebisugaoka is consumed by a sudden fog, transforming her home into a haunting nightmare.<br><br>As the town falls silent and the fog thickens, Hinako must navigate the twisted paths of Ebisugaoka, solving complex puzzles and confronting grotesque monsters to survive.<br><br>Immerse yourself into Hinako's world imagined by renowned author Ryukishi07, with entrancing music, including pieces by Akira Yamaoka, and beautiful visuals in a gripping tale of doubt, regret, and inescapable choices. Will Hinako embrace the beauty hidden within terror, or succumb to the madness that lies ahead?<br><br>Discover a new chapter in the SILENT HILL series, blending psychological horror with a haunting Japanese setting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A self-contained story within the SILENT HILL series</h2>This game is a self-contained story within the SILENT HILL series. Set in 1960s Japan, SILENT HILL f presents a new side of psychological horror.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/0290a6e0c9a0d46f54336df159a8f283.avif?t=1770169624\" width=718 height=404 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story set in 1960s Japan</h2>The setting of the game, a small mountain town in 1960s Japan called Ebisugaoka, as well as the story and characters, have been created just for this game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/59d083fd4a3208368941956af95f8888.poster.avif?t=1770169624\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/59d083fd4a3208368941956af95f8888.webm?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/59d083fd4a3208368941956af95f8888.mp4?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A psychological mystery written by Ryukishi07</h2>From the cryptic lines spoken by Hinako\u2019s friends to the eerie events unfolding around her, the story keeps you guessing.<br>Are the strange phenomena real? A product of Hinako\u2019s imagination? Or something born from ancient local beliefs?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/d984e87c8c029a631bd544cc65c47668.poster.avif?t=1770169624\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/d984e87c8c029a631bd544cc65c47668.webm?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/d984e87c8c029a631bd544cc65c47668.mp4?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A haunting blend of beauty and horror, with sound inspired by Japanese tradition</h2>A grotesque yet aesthetic world is brought to life in stunning 4K visuals.<br>Immersive 3D audio surrounds the player, amplifying tension and unease\u2014even the faintest movement behind you feels disturbingly close.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/93221cd9aaad487698bcc3e36a51529f.poster.avif?t=1770169624\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/93221cd9aaad487698bcc3e36a51529f.webm?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/93221cd9aaad487698bcc3e36a51529f.mp4?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple endings</h2>Your first playthrough ends in a fixed conclusion. But from the second onward, your choices shape the outcome.<br>There are five endings in total\u2014revisit the game to uncover the full truth behind the mystery.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/01ff2a3c9ecc4cdd61161a7a4b91502b.poster.avif?t=1770169624\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/01ff2a3c9ecc4cdd61161a7a4b91502b.webm?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/01ff2a3c9ecc4cdd61161a7a4b91502b.mp4?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Surrounded by Fog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/0d17bb6ecfe5fdf3a36eca6e464c3b4884facd98.jpg"},{"name":"The Fox's Guidance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/91d545f29b1787b191169b435f8be3951b025aea.jpg"},{"name":"Scarecrows' Whispers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/597da826e24c84d9ec1200c6f95b97c305606137.jpg"},{"name":"Cleansed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/f1e995b6d6af3b29492c517311a27841bc0f819a.jpg"},{"name":"On the Way to School...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/f351f9786d7946c16337437ab748de54b4a0b9e4.jpg"},{"name":"Shell of the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/dae332543fc2645d891895f365b712eca6571cb5.jpg"},{"name":"The Farewell Party","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/838358595fce66509a3aed3aaa8a83f8ef544c64.jpg"},{"name":"A Dangerous Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/88966133fe6e99cd392f9e99f1487a29f70d0328.jpg"},{"name":"Plucked Wings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/37514b2391131932a72ed821d07eeac83aef1e75.jpg"},{"name":"Parting on Good Terms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2947440/eebf1bde6bad6b9da42e1573dc266e3eb1f8a1ed.jpg"}],"total":56},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2947440?t=1770169624","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/34252f33ae241fdef2b2895dfeefe0543881be01/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770169624","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/0059b56f4400fe95555b8145d5f8f05b160a54e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770169624","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/0059b56f4400fe95555b8145d5f8f05b160a54e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770169624","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of gender discrimination, child abuse, bullying, drug-induced hallucinations, torture, and graphic violence.\r\n\r\nThis game is set in Japan in the 1960s and contains depictions based on the customs and culture of that time. These depictions do not reflect the opinions or values of the developers or any individuals involved.\r\n\r\nIf you feel uncomfortable at any point while playing, please take a break from playing or speak to someone you trust."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>DELUXE EDITION</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/671332089955de2c84090411ae83ddbf.avif?t=1770169624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras_big/671332089955de2c84090411ae83ddbf.avif?t=1770169624 width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deluxe Edition Contents</h2>- Full Game<br>- Digital Artbook *1<br>- Digital Soundtrack *1<br>- Pink Rabbit Costume *2<br><br>*1<br>The Digital Artbook and Digital Soundtrack are included in a bonus application.<br>The Digital Soundtrack can be downloaded in MP3 or WAV format from the Steam launcher.<br><br>*2<br>This costume changes Hinako's appearance.<br>To apply this costume, access a Hokora in the game and select Change Costume from the menu.<br><br>Note: <br>-The contents of the SILENT HILL f - Deluxe Upgrade are included in this item. Please be careful to avoid redundant purchases.<br>-Digital Soundtrack includes music with lyrics in Japanese.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/73f517192bdffbc5bbb6756dc3093f94.avif?t=1770169624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras_big/73f517192bdffbc5bbb6756dc3093f94.avif?t=1770169624 width=800 height=450 /></span><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In 1960s Japan, Shimizu Hinako's secluded town of Ebisugaoka is consumed by a sudden fog, transforming her home into a haunting nightmare.<br><br>As the town falls silent and the fog thickens, Hinako must navigate the twisted paths of Ebisugaoka, solving complex puzzles and confronting grotesque monsters to survive.<br><br>Immerse yourself into Hinako's world imagined by renowned author Ryukishi07, with entrancing music, including pieces by Akira Yamaoka, and beautiful visuals in a gripping tale of doubt, regret, and inescapable choices. Will Hinako embrace the beauty hidden within terror, or succumb to the madness that lies ahead?<br><br>Discover a new chapter in the SILENT HILL series, blending psychological horror with a haunting Japanese setting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A self-contained story within the SILENT HILL series</h2>This game is a self-contained story within the SILENT HILL series. Set in 1960s Japan, SILENT HILL f presents a new side of psychological horror.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/0290a6e0c9a0d46f54336df159a8f283.avif?t=1770169624\" width=718 height=404 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story set in 1960s Japan</h2>The setting of the game, a small mountain town in 1960s Japan called Ebisugaoka, as well as the story and characters, have been created just for this game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/59d083fd4a3208368941956af95f8888.poster.avif?t=1770169624\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/59d083fd4a3208368941956af95f8888.webm?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/59d083fd4a3208368941956af95f8888.mp4?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A psychological mystery written by Ryukishi07</h2>From the cryptic lines spoken by Hinako\u2019s friends to the eerie events unfolding around her, the story keeps you guessing.<br>Are the strange phenomena real? A product of Hinako\u2019s imagination? Or something born from ancient local beliefs?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/d984e87c8c029a631bd544cc65c47668.poster.avif?t=1770169624\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/d984e87c8c029a631bd544cc65c47668.webm?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/d984e87c8c029a631bd544cc65c47668.mp4?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A haunting blend of beauty and horror, with sound inspired by Japanese tradition</h2>A grotesque yet aesthetic world is brought to life in stunning 4K visuals.<br>Immersive 3D audio surrounds the player, amplifying tension and unease\u2014even the faintest movement behind you feels disturbingly close.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/93221cd9aaad487698bcc3e36a51529f.poster.avif?t=1770169624\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/93221cd9aaad487698bcc3e36a51529f.webm?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/93221cd9aaad487698bcc3e36a51529f.mp4?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple endings</h2>Your first playthrough ends in a fixed conclusion. But from the second onward, your choices shape the outcome.<br>There are five endings in total\u2014revisit the game to uncover the full truth behind the mystery.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/01ff2a3c9ecc4cdd61161a7a4b91502b.poster.avif?t=1770169624\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/01ff2a3c9ecc4cdd61161a7a4b91502b.webm?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/extras/01ff2a3c9ecc4cdd61161a7a4b91502b.mp4?t=1770169624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>","developers":["NeoBards Entertainment Ltd."],"dlc":[3516200],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/7e5d923ac622bd1775ebc9b5d4b5b0a24bf5ed40/header.jpg?t=1770169624","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Konami Digital Entertainment","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947440/1599222287/ea6c61054761168e329da8165ea7eb9e74e74aae/1762933650/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763007191","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947440/1599222287/ea6c61054761168e329da8165ea7eb9e74e74aae/1762933650/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763007191","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947440/1599222287/ea6c61054761168e329da8165ea7eb9e74e74aae/1762933650/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763007191","id":257229920,"name":"SILENT HILL f_Accolade Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229920/39c4a926481250c253db21e89aaa8901f10fe65b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763007191"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2947440/526565829/f5c08af090f9923